  "releaseNotes": "[Version 9.5.12.0] - Updated on Oct 1st 2025:\n---\n(1) Added 2 new attributes `TableDateTimeAuditColumn` and `TableGuidPrimaryKey` equivalent to the base `DateTimeAuditColumn` and `GuidPrimaryKey` attributes, but these \nSQL attributes derive from `TableColummn` attribute and not from the base `ContainerMember` attribute!\n(2) Fixed bug in new attributes, copying properties/settings from `DateTimeAuditColumn` and `GuidPrimaryKey` attributes.",
